discussion_comments.comment_body:
The `lotsOfReplies()` function only attaches a `metadata` listener on the stream — it never handles the actual reply data. Readers running this example will see the headers log but none of the streamed replies. Please add a `data` handler (and ideally an `end` handler) so the example is complete and observable, e.g.:

```js
stream.on('data', (response) => {
  console.log('Reply:', response.getReply());
});
stream.on('end', () => {
  console.log('Stream ended');
});
stream.on('error', (err) => {
  console.error('Error:', err);
});
```
